+"""Tests for Exp5524 V501 execution-time source delta ingestion.
+
+Spec refs: REQ-REPORT-5524, SCENARIO-REPORT-5524-APPEND-DELTAS,
+SCENARIO-REPORT-5524-NO-NEW-DELTA, SCENARIO-REPORT-5524-BLOCKED-MARKER.
